  "job_B9.1.3_20251003_114916": {
    "chunk_text": "nele se slawa erian on \u00d0\u00e6t is \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6t se slawa nylle erian for ciele, \u00f0\u00e6t hwa sie gebunden mid hefignesse \u00f0\u00e6re For\u00f0\u00e6m is gecweden \u00f0\u00e6t se slawa for \u00f0\u00e6m ege \u00f0\u00e6s cieles nylle erigean, for\u00f0\u00e6m we oft for \u00f0\u00e6m Hit is sui\u00f0e wel be \u00f0\u00e6m gecweden \u00f0\u00e6t he eft bedecige on sumera, & him mon \u00f0onne noht ne Sua bi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0e nu on godum weorcum ne sw\u00e6t, & sui\u00f0e ne suince\u00f0: eft \u00f0onne sio sunne, \u00f0\u00e6t Be \u00f0\u00e6m men w\u00e6s eft sui\u00f0e wel gecweden \u00f0urh Salomon \u00f0one snottran, he cw\u00e6\u00f0: Se \u00f0e him & se \u00f0e him \u00e6lc wolcn ondr\u00e6dt, ne rip\u00f0 se n\u00e6fre. Hw\u00e6t getacna\u00f0 \u00f0onne se wind buton \u00f0a costunga \u00f0\u00e6s awrigdan g\u00e6stes, & hw\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t wolc \u00f0e Se wind drife\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t wolcn. Sua de\u00f0 se uncl\u00e6na g\u00e6st mid his winde; He onstyre\u00f0 unryhtwise men. We cw\u00e6don \u00e6r \u00f0\u00e6t se sceolde lytel sawan, se de him \u00f0one wind ondrede; & eft lytel ripan, se \u00f0e him \u00f0a wolc ondrede. Hw\u00e6t is \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6tte sua hwelc sua him ondr\u00e6t o\u00f0\u00f0e deofles costunga o\u00f0\u00f0e yfelra monna Ongean \u00f0\u00e6t is to cy\u00f0anne \u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0e beo\u00f0 to hrade, \u00f0onne hie forhradiga\u00f0 \u00f0one timan godes To swelcum monnum Salomon w\u00e6s sprecende, \u00f0",
